description:
**Job Description**
 We are looking for AI Engineers / Data Scientists to join our AI Solution Team. You will apply data analytics and cutting\-edge AI to solve client projects across various industries. This role is ideal for high\-potential candidates who enjoy bridging the gap between theoretical math and practical, scalable AI solutions.




**Responsibilities**
* Address real\-world business challenges by using computational skills and cross\-category approaches (Computer Science, AI, Statistics, and Mathematics);
* Design and implement AI solutions involving diverse data sources and multi\-modal data (text, image, etc.);
* Participate in the full project and project lifecycle, ensuring AI components align with business objectives and team collaboration processes;


**Requirements**
* Being honest, humble, and a proactive learner;
* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Science, or a related quantitative discipline;
* Experience in Python;
* Strong critical thinking skills with deep, logical reasoning;
* A strong interest or experience in agentic programming and LLM orchestration;
* A strong sense for data structures and algorithms;
* The ability to process large datasets, build models, or formulate real\-world problems using a mathematical approach;
* An understanding of analytics and statistics with a data engineering mindset;
* Familiarity with SQL or NoSQL databases is an advantage;
* Team spirit and proactive idea\-sharing; fluent in both Chinese and English.


 We offer competitive remuneration package including 5\-day work and 15\-day annual leave to the right candidate with excellent career advancement.




 Please submit your application with a 1\-page cover letter outlining your expectations and relevant interests. All applications will be treated in strict confidence. Personal information collected will be used solely for the purpose of recruitment. If you are not invited for an interview within 4 weeks, your application will be filed for a further 2 years and be considered for any other appropriate positions within the company or related companies.




 For more information about ClusterTech, please visit our web site at http://www.clustertech.com.
